msgid "Official STM32F4 drivers and Nexus contracts"
msgstr "官方 STM32F4 驱动与 Nexus 合同"

msgid "Production integration is `soc/stm32/stm32f4/`. Select reviewed exact device and mode facts from [current support](../delivery/support.md), then reuse the locked F4 HAL/LL and CMSIS Device sources. Vendor types and Handles stay private. Internal-CRC software references for added parts do not qualify every peripheral, Board route or physical behavior."
msgstr "生产接入位于 `soc/stm32/stm32f4/`。从[当前支持](../delivery/support.md)选择已审精确器件与模式，再复用锁定的 F4 HAL／LL 和 CMSIS Device。厂商类型与 Handle 保持私有。新增料号的内部 CRC 软件参考不授予全部外设、Board 路线或物理行为资格。"

