msgstr "公共 I/O"

msgid ""
"Stable Nexus types, checked dispatch and hardware-independent contracts"
msgstr "稳定的 Nexus 类型、经检查的分派与硬件无关合同"

msgid "External product"
msgstr "外部产品"

msgid "Tasks, execution progress, private regions and recovery policy"
msgstr "任务、执行推进、私有区域与恢复策略"

msgid ""
"One live hardware behavior domain has one transport owner. HAL and a private"
" state machine must not independently drive the same transfer, DMA or "
"interrupt sources. A hybrid mode needs explicit ownership boundaries, not "
"two competing executors. Direct access requires a specific SDK gap, erratum,"
" atomic ordering contract or demonstrated resource budget."
msgstr ""
"一个活动硬件行为域只有一个传输所有者。HAL 与私有状态机不得独立驱动同一传输、DMA "
"或中断源。混合模式需要明确所有权边界，不能有两个竞争执行器。直接访问必须有明确的 SDK 缺口、勘误、原子顺序合同或经证实的资源预算依据。"

msgid "Build-time provider contract"
msgstr "构建期 provider 合同"

msgid ""
"One schema-2 TOML selects a complete assembly. Reviewed JSON facts resolve "
"into immutable named IR; the generator creates exact storage, configuration,"
" interface faces, typed factory identities and fixed connections. CMake owns"
" the actual source and link graph. Do not duplicate source lists in a "
"manifest."
msgstr ""
"一个 schema-2 TOML 选择完整 assembly。经审阅的 JSON 事实解析为不可变具名 IR；生成器创建精确存储、配置、接口面、类型化 "
"factory 身份与固定连接。CMake 负责真实的源码及链接图。不得在 manifest 中重复维护源码列表。"

msgid ""
"Each image chooses one exact CMSIS device macro and matching startup. "
"Compile only selected HAL modules and required dependencies, with a "
"consistent private configuration and callback ABI. Do not enable every "
"module or modify vendor files. All other inventoried vendor sources remain "
"retained and unselected."
msgstr ""
"每个镜像选择一个精确 CMSIS 设备宏及匹配的启动文件。仅编译所选 HAL 模块和必需依赖，并保持一致的私有配置与回调 "
"ABI。不得启用全部模块或修改厂商文件。其余已盘点厂商源码继续保留且不被选用。"

msgid ""
"Official source admission is shared only within one CMake configure. The "
"first official target verifies the complete selected HAL/CMSIS source and"
" SDK identity, then retains a unique pending input snapshot bound to its "
"SHA256. After all root deferred work, the same complete verification must"
" match the original content, filesystem and Git identity. Rewrites with "
"identical bytes also reject the configure. Intermediate targets still "
"check their own target, device, ABI and private source/include contracts;"
" they do not inherit another target's setup."
msgstr ""
"官方源文件准入仅在同一次 CMake 配置过程中共享。首个官方目标验证所选 HAL/CMSIS 源文件与 SDK 的完整身份，然后保留一个与其 "
"SHA256 绑定的唯一待处理输入快照。所有根级延迟工作完成后，必须再次执行同样的完整验证，并与最初的内容、文件系统及 Git "
"身份一致。即使重写后的字节相同，也会拒绝本次配置。中间目标仍分别检查自身的目标、器件、ABI "
"及私有源文件/包含目录合同；它们不会继承其他目标的设置。"

msgid ""
"The snapshot is build-local input metadata, not a successful test, "
"hardware qualification or persistent cache. Final verification consumes a"
" recognized pending snapshot on success or failure; unrelated malformed "
"files are not deleted. CMake removes its own pending path after every "
"final subprocess result. Each new configure starts a fresh admission. "
"Exact existing input files and missing Git metadata candidates drive "
"reconfiguration; Git lock directories never become timestamp "
"dependencies."
msgstr ""
"快照是构建目录内的输入元数据，不是成功测试、硬件资格认定或持久缓存。最终验证无论成功还是失败，都会消耗已识别的待处理快照；不会删除无关的格式错误文件。每次最终子进程返回结果后，CMake"
" 都会移除自己的待处理路径。每次新的配置都会重新开始准入。确切的现有输入文件和缺失的 Git 元数据候选文件驱动重新配置；Git "
"锁目录绝不会成为时间戳依赖。"

msgid ""
"Default host generation remains centralized Python; Board and SoC trees "
"contain no Python plugins. The generator emits static configuration and "
"fixed typed connections. Core's C platform lifecycle engine owns startup, "
"stop, rollback and diagnostics; F4's `platform_coordinator.c` owns System "
"and shared-resource sequencing with the concrete owners' original receipts. "
"The centralized host configuration implementation is not linked into "
"firmware. Generated factories, C models, linked ARM images and physical "
"behavior retain their separate validation boundaries."
msgstr ""
"默认主机生成器集中使用 Python；Board 和 SoC 树不包含 Python 插件。生成器输出静态配置和固定的类型化连接。Core 的 C "
"平台生命周期引擎负责启动、停止、回滚和诊断；F4 的 `platform_coordinator.c` 使用具体 owner 的原始记录协调 "
"System 和共享资源。集中式主机配置实现不链接到固件。生成 factory、C 模型、ARM 镜像和物理行为保留独立的验证边界。"

msgid "Selected F407 HAL UART transport"
msgstr "所选 F407 HAL UART transport"

msgid ""
"The current finite `dma-tx` selection combines official HAL TX with a "
"disjoint LL IRQ byte/event receiver under one private static owner. Handles,"
" DMA state and callbacks stay private. Other UART modes retain their "
"explicit engines; this selection does not establish whole-library or all-"
"mode HAL replacement."
msgstr ""
"当前有限 `dma-tx` 选择，在同一个私有静态所有者下组合官方 HAL TX 与职责不重叠的 LL IRQ 字节/事件接收。Handle、DMA "
"状态及回调保持私有。其他 UART 模式保留各自明确的引擎；此选择不代表已完成整个库或全部模式的 HAL 替换。"

msgid ""
"DMA completion is distinct from UART wire TC. A callback, successful abort "
"call or timeout does not authorize reuse of a request or buffer. Detach "
"actual DMA, IRQ and callback references, prove required peripheral drain, "
"then publish SETTLED as the provider's final request access. Failed "
"withdrawal retains the same storage and recovery responsibility."
msgstr ""
"DMA 完成与 UART 线路 TC 分别表示不同事实。回调、成功的 abort 调用或超时，都不允许复用请求或缓冲区。必须移除真实 DMA、IRQ "
"和回调引用，证明所需外设已排空，再将 SETTLED 发布为 provider 对请求的最后一次访问。退出失败时保留同一存储和恢复责任。"

msgid ""
"Do not unconditionally call `HAL_Init()`: default SysTick setup and NVIC "
"grouping must respect Platform and RTOS ownership. Use the maintained time "
"domain and validate any kernel ISR ceiling before entering a kernel API."
msgstr ""
"不得无条件调用 `HAL_Init()`：默认 SysTick 设置与 NVIC 分组必须遵守 Platform 和 RTOS "
"所有权。使用受维护的时间域，并在进入内核 API 前验证对应的内核 ISR 优先级上限。"

msgid "F415/F417 basic crypto transports"
msgstr "F415/F417 基础密码运算传输"

msgid ""
"`STM32F415ZGT6` and `STM32F417ZGT6` select `cipher/CRYP` and `hash/HASH` "
"through the existing static factory. Each controller independently "
"selects `irq-blocks` or `dma-blocks`. Selecting one engine's DMA mode "
"does not add the other engine's DMA implementation or storage. This "
"contract does not enable F479 enhanced crypto, authenticated encryption, "
"key storage, padding or protocol policy. SHA1, MD5, DES and TDES "
"availability is a hardware integration fact, not a recommendation for new"
" security protocols."
msgstr ""
"`STM32F415ZGT6` 和 `STM32F417ZGT6` 通过现有静态工厂选择 `cipher/CRYP` 和 "
"`hash/HASH`。每个控制器独立选择 `irq-blocks` 或 `dma-blocks`。为一个引擎选择 DMA "
"模式不会加入另一个引擎的 DMA 实现或存储。本合同不启用 F479 增强密码运算、认证加密、密钥存储、填充或协议策略。SHA1、MD5、DES "
"和 TDES 的可用性是硬件集成事实，不是对新安全协议的建议。"

msgid ""
"The DMA selection adds separate statically allocated channel state and "
"readonly memory-region connections to the same controller owner. CRYP "
"uses DMA2 stream6 channel2 for input and stream5 channel2 for output. "
"HASH uses stream7 channel2 for input. Platform reserves these streams and"
" vectors; their NVIC entries stay disabled. The sole serialized task "
"executor services DMA callbacks. The existing CRYP or HASH_RNG peripheral"
" entry only records its selected engine's facts and completion hints. "
"There is no worker, IRQ scan, runtime registry or maximum pool."
msgstr ""
"DMA 选择为同一控制器所有者增加独立静态分配的通道状态和只读内存区域连接。CRYP 的输入使用 DMA2 stream6 "
"channel2，输出使用 stream5 channel2。HASH 的输入使用 stream7 channel2。Platform "
"预留这些流和向量；对应的 NVIC 项保持禁用。唯一的串行任务执行者服务 DMA 回调。现有 CRYP 或 HASH_RNG "
"外设入口仅记录所选引擎的事实和完成提示。不增加工作线程、IRQ 扫描、运行时注册表或最大容量池。"

msgid ""
"CRYP DMA accepts aligned complete algorithm blocks and rejects exact in-"
"place input/output: independent DMA channels do not prove a safe read-"
"before-write ordering. Key and IV remain standard bytes with the existing"
" format constraints. Query the selected algorithm's alignment, length "
"multiple and maximum rather than inferring requirements from CTR or AES "
"alone."
msgstr ""
"CRYP DMA 接受已对齐的完整算法块，并拒绝输入/输出完全原地重叠：独立 DMA 通道不能证明安全的先读后写顺序。密钥和 IV "
"仍是标准字节，遵守现有格式约束。应查询所选算法的对齐、长度倍数和上限，不能仅根据 CTR 或 AES 推断要求。"

msgid ""
"The locked HASH DMA HAL reads complete words. DMA messages are positive, "
"four-byte aligned and have a byte length divisible by four, at most "
"262140 B. HMAC keys follow the same positive whole-word requirements; "
"plain hashes have no key. `input_length_multiple` and "
"`key_length_multiple` report these rules; the IRQ transport reports one "
"for both. Digest storage remains byte-aligned: the provider reads a "
"proven ready digest through the existing CPU byte copy, without a hidden "
"tail pad, full-message copy or output bounce buffer."
msgstr ""
"锁定版本的 HASH DMA HAL 读取完整字。DMA 消息长度必须为正，起始地址四字节对齐，字节长度可被四整除，且最多为 262140 "
"B。HMAC 密钥遵守相同的正长度和完整字要求；普通散列没有密钥。`input_length_multiple` 和 "
"`key_length_multiple` 报告这些规则；IRQ 传输对两者均报告一。摘要存储仍只要求字节对齐：提供方通过现有 CPU "
"字节复制读取已证明就绪的摘要，不使用隐藏的尾部填充、整条消息复制或输出中转缓冲区。"

msgid ""
"Both transports validate complete descriptor, key, IV, input and output "
"spans before acceptance. DMA domains come from the selected physical "
"memory facts; main SRAM is readable/writable, Flash is readable, and CCM "
"is excluded. Memory TC is not cipher-output completion, HASH digest "
"readiness or request SETTLED. HMAC retains the caller's key through both "
"official key phases and the message phase. Before terminal publication, "
"the owner joins the actual channels and peripheral, withdraws "
"callback/pointer references and clears internal secret context. Failed "
"withdrawal retains the original request and spans as QUARANTINED; cancel,"
" timeout and a successful HAL abort call never authorize their reuse. "
"Caller key/IV storage is not erased by the provider."
msgstr ""
"两种传输都在接受前验证完整的描述符、密钥、IV、输入和输出范围。DMA 域来自所选物理内存事实；主 SRAM 可读写，Flash 可读，CCM "
"被排除。内存 TC 不等于密码运算输出完成、HASH 摘要就绪或请求 SETTLED。HMAC "
"在官方的两个密钥阶段和消息阶段全程保留调用方密钥。发布终态前，所有者汇合实际通道和外设，撤回回调/指针引用并清除内部秘密上下文。撤回失败时，原始请求和范围保持"
" QUARANTINED；取消、超时和成功的 HAL abort 调用都不授权复用它们。提供方不会擦除调用方的密钥/IV 存储。"

msgid ""
"The `stm32f4_crypto` references include an F415 configuration with both "
"DMA transports and an F417 configuration with CRYP DMA and HASH IRQ. They"
" exercise factory composition and source selection. Model execution and "
"ARM linking retain their own source identities; no PCB, throughput, "
"cryptographic certification or physical HIL qualification follows from "
"these references."
msgstr ""
"`stm32f4_crypto` 参考配置包括同时使用两种 DMA 传输的 F415 配置，以及使用 CRYP DMA 和 HASH IRQ 的 "
"F417 配置。它们检验工厂组合与源文件选择。模型执行和 ARM 链接各自保留独立的源身份；这些参考配置不建立 PCB、吞吐量、密码认证或物理 "
"HIL 资格。"

msgid "F407 DAC DMA restart boundary"
msgstr "F407 DAC DMA 重启边界"

msgid "The selected F407 DAC DMA path handles ES0182 Rev19 section 2.6.1 across requests. After request acceptance, restart first proves that the old DMA, IRQ and addresses are detached. It installs the declared idle code, uses the exclusively owned TIM6/7 hardware trigger to observe UDR, then withdraws DMAEN, converter output and clock before reconfiguring DAC, DMA and trigger state. The same owner retains every partial effect if cleanup or clock restoration fails; a timeout never releases the payload early."
msgstr "所选 F407 DAC DMA 路径处理跨 request 的 ES0182 Rev19 第 2.6.1 节边界。请求受理后，重启先证明旧 DMA、IRQ 和地址已经退出，安装声明的 idle 码，通过独占 TIM6／7 硬件触发观察 UDR，再撤回 DMAEN、转换器输出和 clock，随后重新配置 DAC、DMA 与 trigger 状态。清理或时钟恢复失败时，同一 owner 保留每个部分效果；timeout 不提前归还 payload。"

msgid "Only UDR induced during the explicitly controlled recovery phase belongs to recovery rather than payload progress or an independent operational error. It does not by itself replace an expired TIMEOUT with IO. Normal operational underrun still requires explicit stop recovery; failed W1C clearing and real DMA errors remain IO with borrows retained. This is not a rule to ignore every UDR observation."
msgstr "只有显式受控恢复阶段诱发的 UDR 归属恢复，不作为 payload 进度或独立运行故障；它不会单独把已经到期的 TIMEOUT 改为 IO。正常运行欠载仍须显式 stop 恢复；W1C 清零失败和真实 DMA 错误仍是 IO 并保留借用。这不是忽略所有 UDR 观察的规则。"

msgid "Recovery may internally convert the declared idle code before waveform timing starts and briefly disable converter output. These conversions are not payload progress. No uninterrupted analog hold, glitch-free transition or continuous waveform is promised between requests. The C model and ARM image do not establish a silicon-workaround or analog-load qualification. See the [near-source DAC contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/README.md#dac-输出与触发所有权) and public `dac_tx.h` requirements; this is a selected recovery sequence, not a second HAL owner or a general register-script mechanism."
msgstr "恢复可能在波形计时开始前内部转换所声明的 idle 码，并短暂关闭转换器输出。这些转换不是 payload 进度。两次 request 之间不承诺连续模拟保持、无毛刺切换或连续波形。C 模型与 ARM 镜像不建立硅片勘误方案或模拟负载资格。参见[近源 DAC 合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/README.md#dac-输出与触发所有权)和公共 `dac_tx.h` 要求；这是所选恢复序列，不是第二个 HAL owner 或通用寄存器脚本机制。"

msgid "F479 LTDC scanout and DMA2D memory operations"
msgstr "F479 LTDC 扫描输出与 DMA2D 内存操作"

msgid "The selected software reference is STM32F479NIH6. LTDC uses the reviewed AF14 RGB565 or RGB888 wire route; framebuffer memory independently uses RGB565 or ARGB8888. DMA2D has no external pins or DMA1/2 stream. These selections do not qualify a panel, PCB, external framebuffer, bus bandwidth or physical output. FMC presence alone never adds an external region to either engine's DMA domains."
msgstr "所选软件参考为 STM32F479NIH6。LTDC 使用经审核的 AF14 RGB565 或 RGB888 线上路线；帧缓冲内存独立选择 RGB565 或 ARGB8888。DMA2D 没有外部引脚，也不取得 DMA1／2 stream。这些选择不建立面板、PCB、外部帧缓冲、总线带宽或物理输出资格。仅存在 FMC 不会把外部区域加入任一引擎的 DMA 域。"

